Package: miaseriapordo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPS@
Maintainer: Mahmud Razliqli <mahmudrazliqli@yahoo.com>
Description: MiaSeriaPordo - GTK3 serial port monitor and terminal
 MiaSeriaPordo opens a serial port (ttyS*, ttyUSB*, ttyACM*...),
 shows received data as text or hex dump with selectable line
 endings, highlights control characters (\n, \r ...), can send
 data and reconnect automatically at startup.
